  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You deploy your magic as you would a well-prepared blow.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Boxing sphere, caster level 1st.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you would trigger your counter punch, you may choose to use a magic sphere effect that you could create as a standard action in place of performing the counter punch. You may use this ability only once per round even if you could trigger multiple counter punches.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc96\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
